# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improve an SQD estimate with orbital optimization for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Tingkatkan estimasi SQD dengan optimasi orbital untuk versi terbaru Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improve an SQD estimate with orbital optimization"
msgstr "Tingkatkan estimasi SQD dengan optimasi orbital"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/optimize-orbitals.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) approximates a ground-state energy by\n"
"diagonalizing the Hamiltonian in a fixed subspace of electronic configurations. That\n"
"estimate depends on the orbital basis in which the Hamiltonian is expressed, and\n"
"*orbital optimization* (OO) exploits this freedom to lower the energy without enlarging\n"
"the subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) memperkirakan energi ground-state dengan\n"
"mendiagonalisasi Hamiltonian dalam subruang tetap dari konfigurasi elektronik. Estimasi\n"
"itu bergantung pada basis orbital tempat Hamiltonian diekspresikan, dan\n"
"*optimasi orbital* (OO) memanfaatkan kebebasan ini untuk menurunkan energi tanpa memperbesar\n"
"subruang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide runs SQD on an $N_2$ molecule and then improves the result with orbital\n"
"optimization, using [`ffsim`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) to represent\n"
"the Hamiltonian and find the energy-minimizing orbital rotation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menjalankan SQD pada molekul $N_2$ lalu memperbaiki hasilnya dengan optimasi\n"
"orbital, memakai [`ffsim`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) untuk merepresentasikan\n"
"Hamiltonian dan mencari rotasi orbital yang meminimalkan energi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run SQD {#run-sqd}"
msgstr "Jalankan SQD {#run-sqd}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We build the molecular integrals for $N_2$ in the molecular-orbital (MO) basis, generate\n"
"uniform random samples, and run SQD to obtain a ground-state approximation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita bangun integral molekuler untuk $N_2$ dalam basis molecular-orbital (MO), bangkitkan\n"
"sampel acak uniform, lalu jalankan SQD untuk mendapatkan aproksimasi ground-state.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize the orbitals {#optimize-the-orbitals}"
msgstr "Optimalkan orbitalnya {#optimize-the-orbitals}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orbital optimization searches for an orbital rotation that lowers the variational energy\n"
msgstr "Optimasi orbital mencari rotasi orbital yang menurunkan energi variasional\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"E = \\langle \\psi | \\mathcal{U}^\\dagger\\, H\\, \\mathcal{U} | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"E = \\langle \\psi | \\mathcal{U}^\\dagger\\, H\\, \\mathcal{U} | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"of the SQD ground-state approximation $|\\psi\\rangle$. An orbital rotation is specified by\n"
"an $N \\times N$ unitary matrix $\\mathbf{U}$ ($N$ is the number of spatial orbitals), which\n"
"acts on the many-body state through the operator\n"
msgstr ""
"dari aproksimasi ground-state SQD $|\\psi\\rangle$. Sebuah rotasi orbital ditentukan oleh\n"
"matriks unitary $N \\times N$ $\\mathbf{U}$ ($N$ adalah jumlah orbital spasial), yang\n"
"bekerja pada state banyak-benda lewat operator\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\exp\\left[\\sum_{pq, \\sigma} \\log(\\mathbf{U})_{pq}\\, a^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} a_{q\\sigma}\\right].\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\exp\\left[\\sum_{pq, \\sigma} \\log(\\mathbf{U})_{pq}\\, a^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} a_{q\\sigma}\\right].\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ffsim.optimize_orbitals` returns the **matrix** $\\mathbf{U}$, and applying it to the\n"
"orbital basis (via `hamiltonian.rotated`) is equivalent to applying $\\mathcal{U}$ to the\n"
"state. See the\n"
"[ffsim orbital-rotation explanation](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/explanations/orbital-rotation.html)\n"
"for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ffsim.optimize_orbitals` mengembalikan **matriks** $\\mathbf{U}$, dan menerapkannya pada\n"
"basis orbital (lewat `hamiltonian.rotated`) setara dengan menerapkan $\\mathcal{U}$ pada\n"
"state. Lihat\n"
"[penjelasan rotasi orbital ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/explanations/orbital-rotation.html)\n"
"untuk detailnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since rotating the orbitals changes the Hamiltonian seen by the subspace, we alternate\n"
"two steps until the energy stops improving:\n"
msgstr ""
"Karena merotasi orbital mengubah Hamiltonian yang dilihat oleh subruang, kita bergantian\n"
"melakukan dua langkah sampai energi tidak membaik lagi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Diagonalize** the Hamiltonian in the current basis over the fixed set of\n"
"configurations.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Diagonalisasi** Hamiltonian dalam basis saat ini atas himpunan konfigurasi\n"
"yang tetap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Optimize the orbitals** by finding the rotation that minimizes the energy of the\n"
"resulting state, then rotate the integrals into the new basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Optimalkan orbital** dengan mencari rotasi yang meminimalkan energi dari\n"
"state yang dihasilkan, lalu rotasikan integral ke basis yang baru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We delegate the orbital-rotation step to\n"
"[`ffsim.optimize_orbitals`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/ffsim.html#ffsim.optimize_orbitals),\n"
"which finds the energy-minimizing rotation from the one- and two-body reduced density\n"
"matrices (RDMs) of the state. See\n"
"[Sec. II A 4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.05068) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita serahkan langkah rotasi orbital ke\n"
"[`ffsim.optimize_orbitals`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/ffsim.html#ffsim.optimize_orbitals),\n"
"yang mencari rotasi peminimal energi dari reduced density matrix (RDM) satu dan dua benda\n"
"dari state tersebut. Lihat\n"
"[Sec. II A 4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.05068) untuk detailnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why orbital optimization helps here {#why-orbital-optimization-helps-here}"
msgstr "Mengapa optimasi orbital membantu di sini {#why-orbital-optimization-helps-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SCF molecular-orbital (MO) basis is stationary with respect to orbital rotations\n"
"for the *full*-CI problem. But SQD works in a small truncated subspace (here a few\n"
"hundred CI strings out of roughly 19 million full-CI determinants), for which the MO\n"
"basis is generally not optimal, so rotating the orbitals lowers the energy the subspace\n"
"can represent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Basis molecular-orbital (MO) SCF bersifat stasioner terhadap rotasi orbital\n"
"untuk masalah CI *penuh*. Tapi SQD bekerja di subruang terpotong yang kecil (di sini beberapa\n"
"ratus string CI dari sekitar 19 juta determinan full-CI), yang basis MO-nya\n"
"umumnya tidak optimal, sehingga merotasi orbital menurunkan energi yang bisa\n"
"direpresentasikan subruang itu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternate diagonalization and orbital optimization {#alternate-diagonalization-and-orbital-optimization}"
msgstr "Bergantian antara diagonalisasi dan optimasi orbital {#alternate-diagonalization-and-orbital-optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We keep the diagonalization subspace **fixed** to the configurations discovered by SQD\n"
"above, so that each iteration isolates the effect of rotating the orbitals. Each\n"
"iteration:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita jaga subruang diagonalisasi tetap **fixed** pada konfigurasi yang ditemukan SQD\n"
"di atas, supaya setiap iterasi mengisolasi pengaruh rotasi orbital. Setiap\n"
"iterasi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Diagonalizes** the Hamiltonian over the fixed subspace in the current basis, using\n"
"PySCF's selected-CI solver.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mendiagonalisasi** Hamiltonian atas subruang tetap dalam basis saat ini, memakai\n"
"solver selected-CI milik PySCF.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Builds the RDMs** of the resulting state, which is all `ffsim.optimize_orbitals`\n"
"needs.\n"
msgstr "**Membangun RDM** dari state yang dihasilkan, yang merupakan satu-satunya yang dibutuhkan `ffsim.optimize_orbitals`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Optimizes the orbitals**: `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` returns the energy-minimizing\n"
"rotation, which we apply to the integrals to move into the improved basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mengoptimalkan orbital**: `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` mengembalikan rotasi peminimal\n"
"energi, yang kita terapkan ke integral untuk berpindah ke basis yang lebih baik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We record the energy *before* each optimization step. Because the basis improves every\n"
"iteration, this sequence decreases monotonically toward the best energy achievable in\n"
"the fixed subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita catat energi *sebelum* setiap langkah optimasi. Karena basis membaik di setiap\n"
"iterasi, urutan ini menurun secara monoton menuju energi terbaik yang bisa dicapai di\n"
"subruang tetap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the results {#compare-the-results}"
msgstr "Bandingkan hasilnya {#compare-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orbital optimization improves the fixed-subspace estimate, closing much of the gap to\n"
"the exact energy while staying above it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Optimasi orbital memperbaiki estimasi subruang tetap, menutup sebagian besar selisih dengan\n"
"energi eksak sambil tetap berada di atasnya.\n"
